BugReports: https://github.com/leoliu0/fereg/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: stats
Suggests: fixest, testthat (>= 3.0.0), data.table, generics
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.85)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
